      "message": "Thank you for pointing this out. However when we tried to verify this, we don\u0027t see this having any affect:\n\n```\nmount -t cpuset -ocpuset_v2_mode cgroup /dev/cpuset_tmp02\nmount | grep tmp02\ncgroup on /dev/cpuset_tmp02 type cgroup (rw,relatime,cpuset,noprefix,release_agent\u003d/sbin/cpuset_release_agent)\n\n```\n\nWe had used both these changes in our build:\nhttps://lore.kernel.org/all/20250416211752.945849-1-tjmercier@google.com/\nhttps://partner-android.googlesource.com/platform/system/core/+/e1c3f65b88ff77e79f943d66dad7f070e6033414%5E%21/#F0\n\nIs there any other dependency for this change?",
